# Public, non-customer-specific release deny-list. One extended regular
# expression per line. Organization-specific names and identifiers belong in
# a protected WORKAGENT_AI_DENYLIST file supplied by the release environment.
-----BEGIN[[:space:]]+(RSA[[:space:]]+|EC[[:space:]]+|OPENSSH[[:space:]]+)?PRIVATE KEY-----
AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
ASIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,255}
github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{80,255}
xox[baprs]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{20,255}
sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{32,255}
[A-Za-z]:\\Users\\[^\\[:space:]]+
